From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:19:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msimtf: ActiveIMM enumerators, code page and language of a
 layout, message pump owner

- EnumRegisterWordA/W and EnumInputContext return real enumerators over the IME's words and the thread's
  input contexts (Clone, Next, Reset, Skip)
- GetCodePageA answers from the layout's language, GetLangId is the layout's language
- OnDefWindowProc and OnTranslateMessage report "not handled", the message pump owner's Start, End, Pause
  (unique cookies) and Resume succeed; Activate/Deactivate/FilterClientWindows and class factory
  messages are traced instead of reported as FIXMEs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

